	(text_box "16 isolated PLC field positions use software-remapped logical channels to minimize PCB crossings. Dedicated E-stop, HOLD and START optochannels are separate connectors, not shift-register bits. PLC and control channels keep the 2.2 k series limit, indicator LED and reverse diode. U17's two used control channels use individual EL3H7 DIP-4 optocouplers U35/U36; PLC inputs use four LTV-847S SOIC-16W packages. Each output has an individual 4.7 k pull-up and no input-node capacitor. Expansion bits 16-23 are split across two 1x6 headers."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15 15 0.0000)
		(size 190 45)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0.127)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "76362666-7022-4ea9-9557-2cf96431b966")
	)
	(text_box "FIELD COM 0/1 are isolated returns and have no copper connection to GND. Each bank uses one selector: external 24 V wetting or the internal protected isolated 12 V contact supply."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 390 200 0.0000)
		(size 140 35)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0.127)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "fc850dc9-1860-4aec-9fa4-783d344c4b75")
	)
	(text_box "The retired U17 safety quad is replaced by individual EL3H7 DIP-4 optocouplers U35 (E-stop), U36 (HOLD) and U39 (START). Their open-collector outputs drive the RP2350 directly. PLC input groups 1-4, 5-8, 9-12 and 13-16 retain four-channel LTV-847S packages. Every field input uses the same 2.2 k / indicator LED / reverse-diode chain and an individual 4.7 k pull-up. Firmware provides debouncing."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15 205 0.0000)
		(size 250 34)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0.127)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c6db8c56-35a9-4a31-9209-0add87cbb246")
	)
